  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: Security constraint bypass when a collection lists\n     overlapping URL patterns\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-65182.patch: select the security constraint\n       with the longest matching path in RealmBase\n     - CVE-2026-65182\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: Incorrect rewrite rule processing in RewriteValve\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-65927.patch: restart from the first rule on\n       the next flag, skip the whole chain including its terminal rule when\n       a chained rule does not match, always discard the original query\n       string with the qsdiscard flag, and stop parsing the configuration\n       on a read error\n     - CVE-2026-65927",
